# Local-only artefacts (never committed; never deployed)
.local/
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.local

# Build / cache
.bun/
dist/
build/
.tsbuildinfo

# RMS document store — content-addressed binary store; bytes are local
# substrate, never committed (cloud target is Azure Blob + Managed-HSM
# envelope per spec §4.1). The .gitkeep below preserves the dir itself.
data/documents/*
!data/documents/.gitkeep

# D-EVENT-STORE-SCALING Slice 3b (2026-05-10): the dashboard cache is a
# *projection* (Principle 1 — events/sources are truth, projections are
# queries). Slice 3a moved the runtime cache to `.local/`; Slice 3b
# removes the historical baseline `seeds/dashboard-state.json` from the
# commit graph entirely. The recon harness now derives + asserts internal
# consistency at recon time, never compares against a stored cache. The
# file may still exist locally as a one-shot derivation artefact; it is
# never committed.
# See `Owner Inbox/2026-05-10_atlas_d-event-store-scaling-slice-3b-cache-from-commit-graph.md`.
seeds/dashboard-state.json
